<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill lowers US Airways.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill lowers US Airways.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it lowered US Airways Group Inc to near-term neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said kept long-term rating as buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- US Airways was off 1-3/8 to 37-5/8.</p>
</text>
